@startuml
title Workload Allocation and Overload Detection
actor HOD
participant UI
participant API
participant "Workload Service" as WS
database PostgreSQL
HOD -> UI: Allocate teaching activity
UI -> API: POST /workloads/activities
API -> WS: Authorise within department scope
WS -> PostgreSQL: Add historical activity
HOD -> UI: Open workload summary
UI -> API: GET /workloads/{user}
API -> WS: Sum raw and weighted hours
WS -> PostgreSQL: Read configured workload limit
WS --> UI: Utilisation and overload status
@enduml
